{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-22","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f10922"},"reason":"The timeline gave 9 July 1946 as the first fruit-fly flight; that date rests mainly on Wikipedia, while APS News and others document 20 February 1947 (V-2, 109 km, flies recovered alive) as the first animals in space. Timeline and source now use the documented flight.","by":"handcheck-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.aps.org/apsnews/2023/01/fruit-flies-space"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruit_flies_in_space"}],"changes":[{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[440,11],"de":[475,13],"ru":[512,14]},"new":{"en":[467,11],"de":[504,13],"ru":[569,14]}},{"field":"timeline","old":{"start":"1946-07-09","labelEn":"Fruit flies aboard a V-2 rocket become the first living organisms to reach space","labelDe":"Fruchtfliegen an Bord einer V-2-Rakete erreichen als erste Lebewesen den Weltraum","labelRu":"Плодовые мушки на борту ракеты Фау-2 первыми из живых существ достигают космоса"},"new":{"start":"1947-02-20","labelEn":"Fruit flies launched on a V-2 from White Sands reach space and are recovered alive","labelDe":"Mit einer V2 von White Sands gestartete Fruchtfliegen erreichen den Weltraum und werden lebend geborgen","labelRu":"Плодовые мушки, запущенные на Фау-2 с полигона Уайт-Сэндс, достигают космоса и возвращаются живыми"}},{"field":"source","old":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruit_flies_in_space","title":"Fruit flies in space"},"new":{"url":"https://www.aps.org/apsnews/2023/01/fruit-flies-space","title":"February 20, 1947: Fruit flies launched into space – APS News"}}],"hash":"b066a03d59eb"},
